WEBVTT

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.770
It's futile.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.450
I'm not the same as I used to be.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.490
You won't get away from me.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.260
I told you it's futile.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.420
I have surpassed you.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:49.510
Why...

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.530
Why did you have to die?

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:15.360
Blood of the
Reprimanded Dog

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.050
What's going on?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.950
They should be here by now.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.170
Gramps!

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:44.820
Oh, it's you.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:50.200
Akira and Keisuke aren't here yet?

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.200
Nope.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.860
Is Keisuke all right?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.510
I don't know all the details,

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.890
but Akira's bringing him here.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.660
I see.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:03.910
It's taking too long.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.610
Maybe something's happened.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.860
The military has started
shooting all over the town.

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.310
It's total chaos out there.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.570
I hope they're all right.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.600
Wait here a bit longer!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.550
I'll go look for them on the other side.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.370
W-Wait, Rin!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.220
I'll be back soon!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.570
Would you have lived

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.850
if I hadn't been here?

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:56.720
Keisuke...

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.160
Why do you grieve?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.710
Death only means that your
brain will stop functioning

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.550
and your heart will stop beating.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.130
That's all there is to it.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.170
That was decided in the beginning.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.790
It wasn't my decision.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.020
There's nothing left to decide on.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.100
I won't accept this kind of destiny.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.040
You killed Keisuke.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.610
You!!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.710
Those eyes.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:52.960
Your blood.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.930
You won't back out of a fight.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.810
Your blood yearns for battle.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:04:59.970
Shut up!

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.510
Is that all you've got?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.290
Rin!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.780
Akira, are you all right?

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.300
What's he doing?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.120
He looks different...

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.420
Akira, wait!

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:29.100
He...

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.670
He killed Keisuke.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.630
Keisuke?

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.010
Keisuke...

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.520
No way...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.170
He did that to Keisuke.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:46.990
I can't just let that slide.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.340
I'm gonna-

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.610
Akira, don't!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.110
It's not worth it!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.640
Let's go meet with Gramps!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.020
Keisuke would have wanted that too!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:00.910
Your blood.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.870
It yearns to fight.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.850
You must feel it boiling.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.880
Just like mine.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.130
No one here is like you!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.220
Akira!

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.610
I won't let him kill you.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.290
Rin!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.510
Let me at him!

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.470
Akira!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.910
I'm not gonna let you die alone.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.600
So I'll fight too.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.460
Trash.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:54.540
Rin!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.120
Rin!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.780
Akira!

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:44.850
That's it!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:45.720
More!

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.720
More!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.210
Accept this blood

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.830
and show me how you'll overcome this trial!

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.550
Trash...

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:43.220
Rin.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:44.160
Rin?

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:47.170
Akira.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.600
I'm sorry, Rin.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.080
You got hurt because of me.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.120
I don't think I can move...

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.040
Please get out of here.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:00.720
I told you I wouldn't betray you.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:02.770
Akira...

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.210
What are you going to do?

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.690
I don't know.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.160
I still need to do everything.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:12.680
All of it has been there since the beginning.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:18.860
Up until now, I have always been
nothing but a living weapon.

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:21.300
A tool of the military.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:22.920
Then what do you want to do?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.650
I don't need a reason to live.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:31.120
If I were you, I wouldn't let the
military catch me ever again.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:35.800
I'd stop doing what I was told
and live the way I want to live.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.080
That is impossible.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.330
It's not impossible!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:44.550
That's what having a reason
to live is! You have one too.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:49.690
Maybe you'd be able to
smile like a normal person

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.780
if you hadn't been used by the military.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.230
Smile? Me?

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.780
Follow me.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.960
Er, hey...

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.200
It's snowing!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.580
You're on your own from this point on.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.330
And you?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:13.680
You cannot avoid being dyed in some color.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.810
Come with us!

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.480
You two should go.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.000
It's not just CFC, it's the Nikko Group too!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.990
What's going on here?

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:52.950
Even the military is attacking right now.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.790
Well, what should we do?

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.560
You'll protect me.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:01.500
Sure thing, bitch.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.520
Bitch!

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.560
D-Damn it!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.450
Akira! Rin!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:21.770
I was wondering if you were okay.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:23.650
Gramps...

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:24.630
What's up?

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:25.710
Did you get hurt?

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.420
That looks pretty bad.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.620
There.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:35.310
Does it hurt?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.550
No, I'm okay.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.480
So, where's Keisuke?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.690
I see.

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.160
Akira...

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:55.050
Keisuke must have wanted you to live

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.790
so that the pain,

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.470
memories, and souls

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:07.630
of the dead wouldn't
disappear or be forgotten.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:13.550
No matter how hard it can be, the
living have an obligation to fulfill.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.230
There's a reason why your life was spared.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.010
Let's go, Akira.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.980
Let's make sure we get out of Toshima alive.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:32.940
Yeah.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.120
The Nikko Group is out there.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:00.930
Let's hurry.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.770
Akira!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.530
The pure white snow kept
falling and piling up

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:13.380
as if trying to mask the tragedy
that took place in Toshima.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.230
As for me,

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.950
after escaping the Nikko Group,

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.660
I had a quiet life without
anything threatening me.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.520
Peaceful ordinary days.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:49.330
I wonder if my quiet life
here will continue forever?

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:54.930
It's impossible to die in
the middle of battle here.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.030
If I could find it

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:23.090
Who cares for the weed under that thrives

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.650
Let live or die

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.040
Just step on it if... you know

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:33.520
Everybody wants that rush inside

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.890
That hunger to die

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.710
Take the honey

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:42.020
Eat the body, it’s you

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.770
Just a step away

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:54.330
Your mind bleeds on the Hell you’re placed

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.600
Floor on your face

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.850
Shout that Question deep born inside

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:07.050
Where is the Life

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.840
Where is the Pride

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.710
Shadowing the Light

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:16.910
Just a step and you’re away

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:22.040
Down the gates of Hell’s doorway

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:27.300
Just an inch to your own way

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:35.270
This cruel world's damn swift acceleration

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:35.270
This cruel world’s damn swift acceleration

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:51.830
Akira?

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.290
The doctor told me that
you'll be able to walk soon.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:58.910
Yeah.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.580
But for now, you're stuck
in physical therapy.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.210
I'm doing my best.

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:05.260
Good.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.700
Well then, I'll come see you again.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.190
Akira!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:16.100
Will you really, really, come see me again?

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:18.810
Of course.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:20.630
I'm sorry.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.990
I've just been worried

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:26.110
because of the promise you made earlier.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.450
I'll kill you if you break it.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:29.810
Yeah.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.060
I got it.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:33.410
See you later.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:44.840
Oh hey, Akira!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:45.960
Gramps.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.800
You here to visit Rin too?

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:49.220
Yeah.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.350
Where did you get that car from?

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:55.670
You're looking at an
information broker, you know.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:59.190
Nikko Group can be useful.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:05.380
Then you must know about what's
going on in Toshima right now?

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:06.480
Yeah.

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:11.570
Lately there's been talk about
new Line appearing on the market.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.100
But you knew about that, didn't you?

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.370
Yeah.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:22.690
Sounds like the aftereffects will
take this normal town by storm.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:29.590
Until the very end, Keisuke
regretted taking Line.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:35.530
And after suffering through it
and returning to normal, he died.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.380
It must have been painful.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.010
Line brings nothing but suffering.

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.020
That's right.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.130
Akira, how 'bout it?

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.240
It's been a while, shall
we grab something to eat?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.190
Weren't you going to go visit Rin?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.530
Some other time.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:25.460
Up until now, I've lived my life
thinking that nothing mattered.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:30.350
Myself or other people. Dying or living.
Those things didn't concern me.

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:35.770
There wasn't any special meaning to
living just because you weren't dead.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:37.760
That's how I felt.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.020
It was always a mystery to me.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:46.420
How those people, attached to life,

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:52.900
couldn't understand what dying meant to them.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:21:01.600
Maybe I didn't go to Toshima just
to clear away those false charges.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:05.810
Fighting in Bl@ster and Igra
didn't make me feel anything.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:13.190
I thought there might be murderers in
Toshima who were participating in Igra.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.700
Maybe there's something there.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.110
But when I lost Keisuke,

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:29.630
I realized for the first time

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:32.360
that I had been wrong about
everything up until then.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.680
I felt like a stone had blocked my throat.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.050
And now an even greater pain stabs my chest.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.490
This is death.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:49.590
The pain that Keisuke taught me.

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:52.170
The feeling I had lost
sight of and left behind.

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:56.390
I had a realization.

00:21:56.800 --> 00:21:58.290
About life and death

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.990
and the meaning of existence

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.670
and why people are so attached to life.

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:11.730
People could live for something
they couldn't pass on.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:15.250
Something they'd want to protect
or something they'd want to have.

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:16.500
Anything would do.

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:20.850
Thanks to Keisuke, I understood that.

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:36.090
Found your answer yet?

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:43.110
Can you get through this?

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:46.520
I will walk my own path.

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:49.200
For this blood, for the past,

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:52.660
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:52.410
and in memory of what took place here.

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:54.340
I've come here for the sake of all that!

00:22:52.940 --> 00:22:56.800
and no one has even realized that

00:22:54.990 --> 00:22:58.870
Will you be able to rise to these heights?

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:01.820
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:01.550
I'll show you!

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:06.010
Why do you want another punishment?

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:04.690
That's right...

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:08.410
No matter how horrible they are,

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:10.760
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:11.830
you can't just forget your
past or your memories.

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:15.320
I just want to leave them be

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:17.440
I know that the person standing
here right now isn't someone else.

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:23.000
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.490
It's me.

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:28.150
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:28.090
I won't forget the
importance of the lives I took.

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:32.620
I crush my thorny grip

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:38.390
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.660
I'm destined to settle this!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:42.500
Let me shoot through the soul

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:47.450
and dye it rose
